Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-227: spell power, attack power and stat scaling in
 spell tooltip values

Spell_C_GetMinMaxPoints adds the local player's caster share to $s/$m/$o like the server
(SpellDamageBonusDone / SpellHealingBonusDone, F-188 stat scaling): spell_bonus_data coefficients
from DBFilesClient\ZepSpellBonusData.dbc (else DBC EffectBonusMultiplier), BONUS_MULTIPLIER mods,
low-level penalty, AP coefficients, x damage-done %, all before the DAMAGE/DOT modifiers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
